DTSTART:20270210T000000Z
DTEND:20270210T023000Z
SUMMARY:Family Constellations: Rewriting the Patterns in our Relationships\
 , Family and Careers
DESCRIPTION:Family Constellations: A 3-Part Olio Series with Luisa MuhrTues
 days\, February 9\, 16 &amp\; 23 | 7:00pm - 9:30pm | The Olio Lighthouse\,
  Prospect HeightsLimited to 12 participantsFamily Constellations is a ther
 apeutic approach that recognizes how our family's emotional history lives 
 within us\, often unconsciously shaping our experiences\, behaviors\, and 
 struggles. Developed by psychotherapist Bert Hellinger\, the method holds 
 that healing often needs to happen at both the individual and the systemic
  level. Traditional talk therapy focuses mainly on the individual. Family 
 Constellations widens the lens to include the entire family system.In this
  three-part Olio series\, practitioner Luisa Muhr\, will guide us through 
 three areas of life where ancestral entanglements and blocked movements mo
 st often show up. Each session opens with a brief lecture on how that week
 's theme shows up in constellation work. Then we'll experience one or two 
 live constellations together.Week 1\, Feb 9: Parents &amp\; Siblings Our p
 lace in the family\, what we received\, and what we may still be carrying 
 for others.Week 2\, Feb 16: Relationships\, Partnerships &amp\; Children H
 ow the patterns of our family of origin echo in who we love\, how we love\
 , and what we pass on.Week 3\, Feb 23: Profession &amp\; Money Success\, s
 carcity\, and belonging\, and the family loyalties that quietly shape our 
 work and our relationship to money.We're keeping the group to 16 so that w
 e can build off of each session and connect with each other. Over the thre
 e weeks\, anyone who'd like to set up a constellation will have the chance
 \, and everyone takes part as a representative and witness. No one will be
  asked to participate who isn't willing\, and no prior experience is neede
 d. The series builds week to week\, so please plan to attend all three ses
 sions.Important note\, we hav two ticket options for this workshop - Seeke
 r and Representative. For those seeking to address their own specific issu
 es\, there are limited "seeker" spots available. Although the demand might
  exceed the number of seeker slots available\, every participant—whether
  you are a "representative" or an active observer—is destined to be prof
 oundly impacted by this work. Prepare to leave changed.&nbsp\;Your teacher
 : Luisa Muhr is a New York–based interdisciplinary artist and Family &am
 p\; Systemic Constellations practitioner\, originally from Vienna\, Austri
 a\, with Hungarian and Anatolian-Greek roots. She considers herself a "Fie
 ld Worker" and was introduced to Family Constellations in early childhood.
  She later studied with her mentor\, Dr. Peter Orban\, who grew out of the
  early constellation work in Germany. Alongside her healing arts practice\
 , Muhr is an experimental vocalist whose work spans voice\, sound\, moveme
 nt\, improvisation\, installation\, performance art\, and experimental mus
 ic theater. In her own words" Family and Systemic Constellation work is in
 itiating movement deep within the soul. This movement then translates to t
 he practical plane.&nbsp\;I empower people feeling stuck\, lost\, seeking 
 change\, disconnected from their origins and family\, and those having exp
 lored various other healing methods without success\, by guiding them thro
 ugh healing movements\, deeply rooted in their family system."\n\nTickets 
 & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_constellations_1
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_constellations_1
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
